<header><p class="enc-kicker">Term</p><h1 class="enc-title">Pulses</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Pulses are the edible seeds of leguminous plants, such as lentils, peas, chickpeas and beans. They were among the earliest domesticated crops of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/near-east">Near East</a>. In the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mitanni">Mitanni Empire</a>, irrigation along the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khabur-river">Khabur River</a> supported the cultivation of barley, wheat and pulses.</p></div>
